<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32049" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκθρῴσκω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θοροῦμαι</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έθορον</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leap out of,</i>c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκθορε δίφρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.427
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δ᾽ ἔθορε κλῆρος κυνέης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.182
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				23.353
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ.ναῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					457
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραδίη δέ μοι ἔξω στηθέων
				ἐκθρῴσκει,</span> of the violent <i>beating</i> of the
			heart, <i><span class="en">
				11.10.95
			</span></i> : abs., <i>leap forth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπόλλων ἀντίος ἐξέθορε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.539
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				19
			</span></i> : rarely c.acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκτυον ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.371
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>start up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ ὕπνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMar.</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			; <i>come from the womb, to be born,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ap.
				119
			</span></i>.</div>
